{"id":"626a376aca69b0c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-tor.md","title":"Tor Functor","display":"df-tor — Tor Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tor","aliases":["58-df-tor"],"display":"df-tor — Tor Functor","depends_on":["[[58-df-module]]","[[58-df-projective-resolution]]","[[58-df-tensor]]","[[58-df-abelian-group]]","[[58-df-homomorphism]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-chain-complex]]","[[../batch01/58-df-projective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tor — Tor Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef3a5dd6825f0373\" href=\"?note=ef3a5dd6825f0373\" title=\"58-df-module\">58-df-module</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" href=\"?note=a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" title=\"58-df-projective-resolution\">58-df-projective-resolution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9bf75150bce95ccc\" href=\"?note=9bf75150bce95ccc\" title=\"58-df-tensor\">58-df-tensor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f54a13cf4872f4e\" href=\"?note=9f54a13cf4872f4e\" title=\"58-df-abelian-group\">58-df-abelian-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"58-df-chain-complex\">58-df-chain-complex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"82508b70140c7533\" href=\"?note=82508b70140c7533\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-projective.md\">../batch01/58-df-projective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-tor-—-Tor\">df-tor — Tor</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,A,B,T,n,P,d,\\varepsilon,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\in V\">\\(R,A,B,T,n,P,d,\\varepsilon,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorResolutionComplex}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorResolutionComplex}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S\\)</span> 的名称及参数表保留。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>环记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}},0_R,1_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}},0_R,1_R\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}}(r,s)=s\\cdot_Rr\">\\(\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}}(r,s)=s\\cdot_Rr\\)</span>。表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(R^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> 的模载集参数仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，对应运算采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\langle B,+_B,0_B,\\lambda_B\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\langle B,+_B,0_B,\\lambda_B\\rangle\\)</span> 为左模记录；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(q)=\\langle P(q),+_q,0_q,\\lambda_q\\rangle\">\\(U(q)=\\langle P(q),+_q,0_q,\\lambda_q\\rangle\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> 上的左模记录，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_q(p,r)=\\lambda_q(r,p)\">\\(\\rho_q(p,r)=\\lambda_q(r,p)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 上的右作用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_q=\\langle\\mathcal R,\\langle P(q),+_q,0_q,\\rho_q\\rangle,\\mathcal B\\rangle\">\\(D_q=\\langle\\mathcal R,\\langle P(q),+_q,0_q,\\rho_q\\rangle,\\mathcal B\\rangle\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q(q),F_q,N_q,P(q),B,R,D_q)\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q(q),F_q,N_q,P(q),B,R,D_q)\\)</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\">\\(+_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\">\\(\\iota_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\\)</span> 是该构造的陪集加法和纯张量函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^I\">\\(V^I\\)</span> 仅表示定义域为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的集合函数类；二元运算以有序对为自变量。以下出现的结构分量均从当前量化的记录中取得，不在不同箭头处重新选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"82508b70140c7533\" href=\"?note=82508b70140c7533\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-projective.md\">../batch01/58-df-projective.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroElement}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"58-df-chain-complex\">58-df-chain-complex</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" href=\"?note=a1ff59b2909a8ac7\" title=\"58-df-projective-resolution\">58-df-projective-resolution</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(\\mathcal B,B,\\mathcal R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land P,U,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\in V^\\omega\\land d\\in V^{\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(U(q),P(q),\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists F_q,N_q\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q(q),F_q,N_q,P(q),B,R,D_q)\n\\land+_Q(q)=+_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\\land\\iota(q)=\\iota_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z(q),Q(q),+_Q(q))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(d(q);P(q),+_q,\\lambda_q;P(q-1),+_{q-1},\\lambda_{q-1};R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\partial_B(q),Q(q),+_Q(q),Q(q-1),+_Q(q-1))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in P(q)\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;\n\\partial_B(q)(\\iota(q)(p,b))=\\iota(q-1)(d(q)(p),b)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\;\\forall x\\in Q(q)\\;\n\\partial_B(q-1)(\\partial_B(q)(x))=z(q-2).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(\\mathcal B,B,\\mathcal R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land P,U,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\in V^\\omega\\land d\\in V^{\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(U(q),P(q),\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists F_q,N_q\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q(q),F_q,N_q,P(q),B,R,D_q)\n\\land+_Q(q)=+_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\\land\\iota(q)=\\iota_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z(q),Q(q),+_Q(q))\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(d(q);P(q),+_q,\\lambda_q;P(q-1),+_{q-1},\\lambda_{q-1};R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\partial_B(q),Q(q),+_Q(q),Q(q-1),+_Q(q-1))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in P(q)\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;\n\\partial_B(q)(\\iota(q)(p,b))=\\iota(q-1)(d(q)(p),b)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\;\\forall x\\in Q(q)\\;\n\\partial_B(q-1)(\\partial_B(q)(x))=z(q-2).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorResolutionComplex}_S(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B\\;\n\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TensorResolutionComplex}_S(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B\\;\n\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tor\\text{-}homology\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall F\\in\\{Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z\\}\\;\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\operatorname{dom}(F),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\n\\land\\{n,n+1\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(Q)\\land n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(+_Q)\n\\land n+1\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\partial_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_Q(n),Q(n)\\times Q(n),Q(n))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial_B(n+1),Q(n+1),Q(n))\n\\land\\bigl(n&gt;0\\to n-1\\in\\operatorname{dom}(Q)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(z)\n\\land n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\partial_B)\\land z(n-1)\\in Q(n-1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial_B(n),Q(n),Q(n-1))\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists Z_n,B_n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nZ_n=\\begin{cases}Q(0),&amp;n=0,\\\\\\{x\\in Q(n):\\partial_B(n)(x)=z(n-1)\\},&amp;n&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\land\nB_n=\\{\\partial_B(n+1)(y):y\\in Q(n+1)\\}\\land\nT=\\bigl\\{\\{+_Q(n)(\\langle z_0,b\\rangle):b\\in B_n\\}:z_0\\in Z_n\\bigr\\}\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tor\\text{-}homology\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall F\\in\\{Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z\\}\\;\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\operatorname{dom}(F),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\n\\land\\{n,n+1\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(Q)\\land n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(+_Q)\n\\land n+1\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\partial_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_Q(n),Q(n)\\times Q(n),Q(n))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial_B(n+1),Q(n+1),Q(n))\n\\land\\bigl(n&gt;0\\to n-1\\in\\operatorname{dom}(Q)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(z)\n\\land n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\partial_B)\\land z(n-1)\\in Q(n-1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial_B(n),Q(n),Q(n-1))\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists Z_n,B_n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nZ_n=\\begin{cases}Q(0),&amp;n=0,\\\\\\{x\\in Q(n):\\partial_B(n)(x)=z(n-1)\\},&amp;n&gt;0,\\end{cases}\\land\nB_n=\\{\\partial_B(n+1)(y):y\\in Q(n+1)\\}\\land\nT=\\bigl\\{\\{+_Q(n)(\\langle z_0,b\\rangle):b\\in B_n\\}:z_0\\in Z_n\\bigr\\}\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,R,A,B,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,U,P,d,\\varepsilon,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal A,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,R,A,B,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,U,P,d,\\varepsilon,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal A,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal A,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\n\\to\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,R,A,B,n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal A,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\n\\to\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,R,A,B,n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>仍以投射分解张量后的同调陪集作为 Tor 的载集代表；不把不同分解的同构代表宣称为字面相等。张量、零元、加法和微分现由同一组环及模数据确定。原结论的独立存在投影前提不足以保证结构兼容，故结论中的见证改为共享的显式记录。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-tor-—-Tor","text":"df-tor — Tor","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-module","status":"resolved","id":"ef3a5dd6825f0373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-module]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-projective-resolution]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tensor","status":"resolved","id":"9bf75150bce95ccc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tensor]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-group","status":"resolved","id":"9f54a13cf4872f4e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-abelian-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain-complex","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain-complex]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-projective.md","status":"resolved","id":"82508b70140c7533","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-projective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-projective.md","status":"resolved","id":"82508b70140c7533","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}$ 取 [[../batch01/58-df-projective.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}$ 取 [[58-df-homomorphism]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-chain-complex","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZeroElement}$ 取 [[58-df-chain-complex]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-resolution","status":"resolved","id":"a1ff59b2909a8ac7","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}$、$\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}$ 取 [[58-df-projective-resolution]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,A,B,T,n,P,d,\\varepsilon,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorResolutionComplex}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}},0_R,1_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot_R^{\\mathrm{op}}(r,s)=s\\cdot_Rr","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\langle B,+_B,0_B,\\lambda_B\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"U(q)=\\langle P(q),+_q,0_q,\\lambda_q\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_q(p,r)=\\lambda_q(r,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"D_q=\\langle\\mathcal R,\\langle P(q),+_q,0_q,\\rho_q\\rangle,\\mathcal B\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q(q),F_q,N_q,P(q),B,R,D_q)","display":false},{"tex":"+_{q,\\mathrm{can}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{q,\\mathrm{can}}","display":false},{"tex":"V^I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroElement}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal R=\\langle R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(\\mathcal B,B,\\mathcal R)\\\\\n&\\land P,U,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\in V^\\omega\\land d\\in V^{\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ModuleRecord}_{58}(U(q),P(q),\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\exists F_q,N_q\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{TensorProductData}_{58}(Q(q),F_q,N_q,P(q),B,R,D_q)\n\\land+_Q(q)=+_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\\land\\iota(q)=\\iota_{q,\\mathrm{can}}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZeroElement}_S(z(q),Q(q),+_Q(q))\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ModuleHomStructure}_S(d(q);P(q),+_q,\\lambda_q;P(q-1),+_{q-1},\\lambda_{q-1};R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(\\partial_B(q),Q(q),+_Q(q),Q(q-1),+_Q(q-1))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall p\\in P(q)\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;\n\\partial_B(q)(\\iota(q)(p,b))=\\iota(q-1)(d(q)(p),b)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0,1\\}\\;\\forall x\\in Q(q)\\;\n\\partial_B(q-1)(\\partial_B(q)(x))=z(q-2).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorResolutionComplex}_S(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B\\;\n\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tor\\text{-}homology\\text{-}carrier} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\n\\forall F\\in\\{Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z\\}\\;\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\operatorname{dom}(F),\\operatorname{ran}(F))\n\\land\\{n,n+1\\}\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(Q)\\land n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(+_Q)\n\\land n+1\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\partial_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(+_Q(n),Q(n)\\times Q(n),Q(n))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial_B(n+1),Q(n+1),Q(n))\n\\land\\bigl(n>0\\to n-1\\in\\operatorname{dom}(Q)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(z)\n\\land n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\partial_B)\\land z(n-1)\\in Q(n-1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\partial_B(n),Q(n),Q(n-1))\\bigr)\n\\land\\exists Z_n,B_n\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nZ_n=\\begin{cases}Q(0),&n=0,\\\\\\{x\\in Q(n):\\partial_B(n)(x)=z(n-1)\\},&n>0,\\end{cases}\\land\nB_n=\\{\\partial_B(n+1)(y):y\\in Q(n+1)\\}\\land\nT=\\bigl\\{\\{+_Q(n)(\\langle z_0,b\\rangle):b\\in B_n\\}:z_0\\in Z_n\\bigr\\}\n\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,R,A,B,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&n\\in\\omega\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal R,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,U,P,d,\\varepsilon,Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z\\;\\bigl[\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal A,U)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProjectiveResolutionData}_{58}(P,d,\\varepsilon,A,R,\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal A,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{TensorResolutionData}_{58}(Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,\\iota,z;P,d,B,R,\\mathcal R,U,\\mathcal B)\\\\\n\\land\\mathrm{HomologyCarrier}_S(T,n;Q,+_Q,\\partial_B,z)\n\\to\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S(T,R,A,B,n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":5630,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e365ef412503e95","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3ff9bab1e15a730d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TorGroup}_S$ (Tor-carrier predicate, see [[58-df-tor]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-tor.md|58-df-tor]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["ef3a5dd6825f0373","a1ff59b2909a8ac7","9bf75150bce95ccc","9f54a13cf4872f4e","f32a973b59a825e4","36d7463d215be751","c3537edf2017d84e","82508b70140c7533"]}